<title>NETHERLANDS: LCI acquires System Plus Rotterdam.</title>
<headline>LCI acquires System Plus Rotterdam.</headline>
<dateline>DEN BOSCH, Netherlands 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>LCI Computer Group NV said it had reached an agreement to acquire 100 percent of the shares of System Plus Rotterdam BV.</p>
<p>LCI said the acquisition would be paid for in shares which would be issued in four annual tranches.</p>
<p>System Plus has annual sales of some 13 million guilders and is active in the Rotterdam area in information technology, consultancy and related services.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
